type: software
title: "s-SNOM Spectrum Calculator"
abstract: >-
  A Streamlit application and Python toolkit for calculating normalized
  scattering-type scanning near-field optical microscopy (s-SNOM) spectra of
  bulk materials and finite-layer stacks with a spheroid tip model.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
